                                                "sense_id": "5d0a697e-17bd-3037-8496-0b1c546654d2",
                                                "text": "In lulling strains the feather'd warblers woo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa2c88b2-8528-4962-bfd8-063767038be3",
                                                "sense_id": "5d0a697e-17bd-3037-8496-0b1c546654d2",
                                                "text": "And it looked like at first she was just another pop warbler, and “Girls Just Want to Have Fun” is a great record, but nothing threatening, nothing strange."
